paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {m = {\iiint\limits_{E}{K\sqrt{x^{2} + y^{2}}\mathit{dV} = {\int_{0}^{\pi}{\int_{0}^{1}{\int_{1 - r^{2}}^{4}{{({Kr})}r\mathit{dz}\mathit{dr}d\theta}}}}}}} \\
  {\phantom{m} = {\int_{0}^{\pi}{\int_{0}^{1}{Kr^{2}{\lbrack{4 - {({1 - r^{2}})}}\rbrack}\mathit{dr}d\theta = K{\int_{0}^{\pi}{d\theta{\int_{0}^{1}{{({3r^{2} + r^{4}})}\mathit{dr}}}}}}}}} \\
  {\phantom{m} = {\pi K\left\lbrack r^{3} + \frac{r^{5}}{5} \right\rbrack_{0}^{1} = \frac{6\pi K}{5}}}
  \end{array}$$
